{"id":16389700566,"name":"Ko Prey Village🍀[VC🔊]","desc":"🌿 Welcome to Ko Prey Village🌿\nStep into a peaceful world full of trees, rivers, mountains, and open skies. 🌳☁️\nThis game is designed for chilling with friends, exploring the beauty of nature, and enjoying calm vibes.\n\n✨ Features:\n\n🌲Relaxing forests \n💧Waterfalls & rivers \n🔥Cozy campfire spots \n🪵Chill hangout areas \n📸Scenic photo spots \n\n🌸 Whether you want to chat, roleplay, or simply enjoy the sounds of nature, this hangout is the perfect place.\n💚 Invite your friends and escape the busy world into a calm natural paradise!","path":"/game/16389700566-ko-prey-village","slug":"16389700566-ko-prey-village","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/57dd706aeaf32e80cb41521167bbc2be10fb4f7317ae776b1fc813039484c243.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ad7edae006760f11365c965416437b1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":148,"visitor":3529337,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-20T06:22:59.444Z","creator":{"name":"Ko prey","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"694640c30d904aa5d1390fc7","title":"Money Gun Server Crasher","game":{"_id":"694640c30d904aa5d1390fc4","gameId":16389700566,"name":"Ko Prey Village🍀[VC🔊]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0a41120fe93833c0688ab2541b68604e740192bd42a98b599fe450d118f7b4d9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-950188b49d05c39dd398fe965faa1dc7-66b789bf1d36.png"},"slug":"16389700566-ko-prey-village","path":"/game/16389700566-ko-prey-village","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0a41120fe93833c0688ab2541b68604e740192bd42a98b599fe450d118f7b4d9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-950188b49d05c39dd398fe965faa1dc7-66b789bf1d36.png"},"placeId":16389700566},"slug":"Ko-Prey-VillageVC-Money-Gun-Server-Crasher-76350","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1880,"executes":2079,"scriptType":"free","